# Supabase Edge Functions & Webhook Environment Variables
# Copy these to your environment or deploy using `npx supabase secrets set`

# 1. Resend API Key (from https://resend.com/api-keys)
RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_api_key_here

# 2. Verified Sender Email in Resend
RESEND_FROM_EMAIL=MAAHI PRODUCTS <orders@yourverifieddomain.com>

# 3. Webhook Secret for Authenticating Database Webhooks
WEBHOOK_SECRET=your_secure_webhook_secret_here
